# Copy to your shell profile or session, or place this file in the working
# directory as .env (real environment variables always win). Never commit
# real values. The browser transport has no API key.

# Optional override of the browser-transport state directory (default
# ~/.upwork-axi). Mainly for tests and development.
# UPWORK_STATE_DIR=~/.upwork-axi

# Optional explicit path to the Chrome/Chromium binary used for the
# persistent Upwork session. Auto-detected when unset: installed Google
# Chrome first, then any Playwright-installed chromium.
# UPWORK_BROWSER_BIN=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome
